{"v":4,"catch":"奏響神樂，復興幻想鄉！","desc":"《東方彈幕神樂 失落幻想》是一款東方Project官方認證二次創作音樂動作遊戲。\n遊戲中存在兩種模式，分別是通過音樂遊戲【彈幕神樂】來解明幻想鄉毀滅之謎的“劇情模式”，以及可以盡情暢玩音樂遊戲的“自由模式”。\n可以通過4種難易度來享受本遊戲豐富的東方改編曲曲庫。","publisher":"Alliance Arts","release":"2024-09-05","genres":["音樂","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 8.0GB / Switch 8.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fdb11a97f6daf2dbe1c6daec1fc6e9106968a6572b9045a9aec478bccbae77d2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1538eba34c551182af6ee0bc17409264cdc6f93b908061d59e648282629eafff.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f770f2c9e475772f708517094ddee7f03e65c6f92dba4bd3e074641c5ae94965.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4c73ae34ef6cca393b27d94f214f004d664852de66dc5b1cd9af7ec42b01686e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6fbf43ca3e2d7b7f7e1f9ba6f0afda900feb88f24e16115079bbb7a0d57b17a0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/10560b2bca1f2b4e959efb8fd72f05efd5f6ba55402d4565c26338a0f87c6793.jpg"],"titleId":"010082301ec24000","dlc":[]}